<import src="../../templates/rows.wxml"/><import src="../../templates/passport.wxml"/><view class="app theme-{{theme}}"><view class="wrap me-wrap"><view class="mehead"><image src="/assets/icon.png"/><view><view class="h2">我的</view><view class="sub">想去和去过的餐厅，保存在这台设备上</view></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="passport" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">美食护照</view><view class="small">签章与我的旅行记录</view></view><text>{{folds.passport?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.passport}}"><template is="passport" data="{{opened,stats,wantCount,beenCount,countries,cities,levelCounts,passportPages,bookIndex,bookScale,bookHeight}}"/></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="trips" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">旅行美食地图</view><view class="small">规划旅程，收藏沿途餐厅</view></view><text>{{folds.trips?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.trips}}"><view class="travel-heading"><view><view class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT JOURNEY</view><view class="h3">把想吃的，放进旅程。</view></view><view class="btn primary" bindtap="newTrip">＋ 创建旅行</view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!trips.length}}">创建一次旅行，把想去的餐厅收进同一张地图。</view><view class="trip-card" wx:for="{{trips}}" wx:key="id"><view class="h4">{{item.name}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.ids.length}} 家餐厅</view><view class="links"><view class="action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tripMap">▧ 旅行地图</view><view class="action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="renameTrip">编辑旅行</view></view></view></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="collection" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">餐厅清单</view><view class="small">想去 {{wantCount}} · 去过 {{beenCount}}</view></view><text>{{folds.collection?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.collection}}"><view class="metabs"><view class="seg"><view class="{{collection==='want'?'selected':''}}" data-value="want" bindtap="changeCollection">想去</view><view class="{{collection==='been'?'selected':''}}" data-value="been" bindtap="changeCollection">去过</view></view><view class="seg"><view class="{{order==='time'?'selected':''}}" data-value="time" bindtap="changeOrder">最近标记</view><view class="{{order==='place'?'selected':''}}" data-value="place" bindtap="changeOrder">按地区</view><view class="{{order==='score'?'selected':''}}" data-value="score" bindtap="changeOrder">按评分</view></view></view><template is="rows" data="{{groups}}"/><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!groups.length}}">还没有餐厅记录，去名录找一家喜欢的店吧。</view></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="sync" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">云端同步</view><view class="small">手机与电脑，共享一份收藏</view></view><text>{{folds.sync?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.sync}}"><view class="sub">当前尚未配置统一账户，可先通过备份迁移文字记录。</view><view class="btn" bindtap="syncInfo">同步说明</view></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="backup" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">备份与恢复</view><view class="small">导出一份，安心保留</view></view><text>{{folds.backup?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.backup}}"><view class="cell" bindtap="exportBackup">导出清单<text class="r">复制备份内容 ›</text></view><view class="cell" bindtap="importBackup">导入清单<text class="r">从剪贴板恢复 ›</text></view><view class="note">换手机或清理微信数据之前，请先导出备份。支持网站版文字备份格式。</view></view></view><view class="me-fold"><view class="fold-summary" data-fold="settings" bindtap="fold"><view><view class="strong">偏好与关于</view><view class="small">主题、语言与使用帮助</view></view><text>{{folds.settings?'⌄':'›'}}</text></view><view class="me-fold-body" wx:if="{{folds.settings}}"><view class="cell"><text>主题</text><view class="seg r"><view wx:for="{{['跟随系统','浅色','深色']}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{themeSetting===['auto','light','dark'][index]?'selected':''}}" data-value="{{['auto','light','dark'][index]}}" bindtap="setTheme">{{item}}</view></view></view><view class="cell" bindtap="about">等级怎么分、怎么评<text class="r">›</text></view><view class="cell" bindtap="feedback">纠错与反馈<text class="r">GitHub ›</text></view><view class="note">城市中文名参考 GeoNames 地名资料与参考音译，导航保留原文。本站与米其林、黑珍珠官方无关。</view></view></view></view></view>